1
00:00:00,903 --> 00:00:02,802
As Uke comes to take the wrist

2
00:00:03,103 --> 00:00:05,074
draw him down slightly to your center,

3
00:00:05,075 --> 00:00:06,466
controlling his wrist

4
00:00:06,467 --> 00:00:10,960
draw him in tightly into your body
so Uke comes completely around you,

5
00:00:10,961 --> 00:00:12,136
as he does so

6
00:00:12,137 --> 00:00:15,835
cut down and place him directly in front of you.

